                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </button>
              <div class="faq-item__answer">
                <div class="faq-item__answer-content">
                  <p>Our products generally run true to size, but we recommend checking the specific size guide for each item as sizing can vary slightly between different styles and collections. Customer reviews often include feedback on sizing that may be helpful as well.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
